[{"tag_name":"v2.0.0-beta.5","name":"ARC Assistant v2.0.0-beta.5","body":"# ARC Assistant v2.0.0-beta.5\n\nA new workspace design, built-in GitHub source control, clearer settings, and faster navigation between pages, documents, and changed files.\n\n## New in beta.5\n\n- Improved mind map details, editing, and activity tracking.\n- Improved AI project action handling and review.\n- Release catalog support to reduce anonymous GitHub API limits.\n\n## Included from beta.4\n\n- Redesigned About & updates page with all published versions loaded automatically from GitHub.\n- Browse stable and preview releases, read release notes, download installers, and switch versions inside ARC where signed updates are available.\n- Fixed preview update checks: v2 previews now find newer preview releases without changing the v1 stable channel.\n- A simpler update notification with accurate download progress, installation status, retry controls, and a restart prompt.\n\n**Upgrading from beta.2 or beta.3:** download and install beta.4 manually once. Those older builds use the stable-only update feed; beta.4 includes the fixed updater for future releases.\n\n## Downloads\n\n- **Windows:** download the file ending in `x64-setup.exe` and run it. An `.msi` installer is also available.\n- **Mac (Apple Silicon and Intel):** download the file ending in `universal.dmg`, open it, and drag ARC Assistant into Applications. Requires macOS 10.15 or newer (macOS 11 or newer on Apple Silicon).\n\nThe Mac preview is ad-hoc signed, without Apple notarization. On first open you may need to approve ARC Assistant in **System Settings → Privacy & Security → Open Anyway**. Only approve the download from this release page.\n\nSource control requires Git and GitHub CLI on either system. Sign in to GitHub from Repository settings inside ARC.\n\nThis is a preview release. Existing v1 users stay on the stable update channel. Installing v2 uses the same saved ARC app data, so back up important local work before trying the preview.\n\nThe source code stays in the private source repository, on the `codex/v2` branch. The source archives on this public download repository contain its download-page files, not the private application source.\n","prerelease":true,"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:47:35Z","assets":[{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.5_universal.dmg","size":10547165,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.5/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.5_universal.dmg"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.5_x64-setup.exe","size":4328260,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.5/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.5_x64-setup.exe"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.5_x64-setup.exe.sig","size":436,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.5/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.5_x64-setup.exe.sig"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.5_x64_en-US.msi","size":5255168,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.5/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.5_x64_en-US.msi"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.5_x64_en-US.msi.sig","size":436,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.5/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.5_x64_en-US.msi.sig"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_universal.app.tar.gz","size":10409830,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.5/ARC.Assistant_universal.app.tar.gz"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_universal.app.tar.gz.sig","size":412,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.5/ARC.Assistant_universal.app.tar.gz.sig"},{"name":"latest.json","size":4121,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.5/latest.json"}]},{"tag_name":"v2.0.0-beta.4","name":"ARC Assistant v2.0.0-beta.4","body":"# ARC Assistant v2.0.0-beta.4\n\nA new workspace design, built-in GitHub source control, clearer settings, and faster navigation between pages, documents, and changed files.\n\n## New in beta.4\n\n- Redesigned About & updates page with all published versions loaded automatically from GitHub.\n- Browse stable and preview releases, read release notes, download installers, and switch versions inside ARC where signed updates are available.\n- Fixed preview update checks: v2 previews now find newer preview releases without changing the v1 stable channel.\n- A simpler update notification with accurate download progress, installation status, retry controls, and a restart prompt.\n\n**Upgrading from beta.2 or beta.3:** download and install beta.4 manually once. Those older builds use the stable-only update feed; beta.4 includes the fixed updater for future releases.\n\n## Downloads\n\n- **Windows:** download the file ending in `x64-setup.exe` and run it. An `.msi` installer is also available.\n- **Mac (Apple Silicon and Intel):** download the file ending in `universal.dmg`, open it, and drag ARC Assistant into Applications. Requires macOS 10.15 or newer (macOS 11 or newer on Apple Silicon).\n\nThe Mac preview is ad-hoc signed, without Apple notarization. On first open you may need to approve ARC Assistant in **System Settings → Privacy & Security → Open Anyway**. Only approve the download from this release page.\n\nSource control requires Git and GitHub CLI on either system. Sign in to GitHub from Repository settings inside ARC.\n\nThis is a preview release. Existing v1 users stay on the stable update channel. Installing v2 uses the same saved ARC app data, so back up important local work before trying the preview.\n\nThe source code stays in the private source repository, on the `codex/v2` branch. The source archives on this public download repository contain its download-page files, not the private application source.\n","prerelease":true,"published_at":"2026-10-17T23:59:58Z","assets":[{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.4_universal.dmg","size":10533599,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.4/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.4_universal.dmg"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.4_x64-setup.exe","size":4318254,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.4/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.4_x64-setup.exe"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.4_x64-setup.exe.sig","size":436,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.4/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.4_x64-setup.exe.sig"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.4_x64_en-US.msi","size":5242880,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.4/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.4_x64_en-US.msi"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.4_x64_en-US.msi.sig","size":436,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.4/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.4_x64_en-US.msi.sig"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_universal.app.tar.gz","size":10386299,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.4/ARC.Assistant_universal.app.tar.gz"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_universal.app.tar.gz.sig","size":412,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.4/ARC.Assistant_universal.app.tar.gz.sig"},{"name":"latest.json","size":3913,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.4/latest.json"}]},{"tag_name":"v2.0.0-beta.3","name":"ARC Assistant v2.0.0-beta.3","body":"# ARC Assistant v2.0.0-beta.3\n\nA new workspace design, built-in GitHub source control, clearer settings, and faster navigation between pages, documents, and changed files.\n\n## New in beta.3\n\n- A simpler sign-in screen and browser confirmation that match ARC.\n- Muted green-grey ARC colours by default for fresh installs. Existing colour choices are kept.\n- A simpler website with a Windows download button and browser access.\n\n## Downloads\n\n- **Windows:** download the file ending in `x64-setup.exe` and run it. An `.msi` installer is also available.\n- **Mac (Apple Silicon and Intel):** download the file ending in `universal.dmg`, open it, and drag ARC Assistant into Applications. Requires macOS 10.15 or newer (macOS 11 or newer on Apple Silicon).\n\nThe Mac preview is ad-hoc signed, without Apple notarization. On first open you may need to approve ARC Assistant in **System Settings → Privacy & Security → Open Anyway**. Only approve the download from this release page.\n\nSource control requires Git and GitHub CLI on either system. Sign in to GitHub from Repository settings inside ARC.\n\nThis is a preview release. Existing v1 users stay on the stable update channel. Installing v2 uses the same saved ARC app data, so back up important local work before trying the preview.\n\nThe source code stays in the private source repository, on the `codex/v2` branch. The source archives on this public download repository contain its download-page files, not the private application source.\n","prerelease":true,"published_at":"2026-10-17T23:31:54Z","assets":[{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.3_universal.dmg","size":10526227,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.3/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.3_universal.dmg"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.3_x64-setup.exe","size":4313805,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.3/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.3_x64-setup.exe"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.3_x64-setup.exe.s