nload from this release page.\n\nSource control requires Git and GitHub CLI on either system. Sign in to GitHub from Repository settings inside ARC.\n\nThis is a preview release. Existing v1 users stay on the stable update channel. Installing v2 uses the same saved ARC app data, so back up important local work before trying the preview.\n\nThe source code stays in the private source repository, on the `codex/v2` branch. The source archives on this public download repository contain its download-page files, not the private application source.\n","prerelease":true,"published_at":"2026-10-17T22:25:05Z","assets":[{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.2_universal.dmg","size":10527200,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.2/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.2_universal.dmg"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.2_x64-setup.exe","size":4313600,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.2/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.2_x64-setup.exe"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.2_x64-setup.exe.sig","size":436,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.2/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.2_x64-setup.exe.sig"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.2_x64_en-US.msi","size":5238784,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.2/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.2_x64_en-US.msi"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.2_x64_en-US.msi.sig","size":436,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.2/ARC.Assistant_2.0.0-beta.2_x64_en-US.msi.sig"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_universal.app.tar.gz","size":10376611,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ARC-DEVELOPMENT-A/arc-assistant-releases/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.2/ARC.Assistant_universal.app.tar.gz"},{"name":"ARC.Assistant_universal.ap